  7	<meta name="description" content="Searchable per-gene audit: which 'organoid-specific' cancer dependencies from the 2026 Broad and Sanger catalogues are consistent with culture-medium effects, which with 3D format, and which survive. 17,525 genes, held-out confirmed, adversarially reviewed.">
